The film and series entries in src/data/catalogue.ts are short factual summaries
used for demonstration. Artwork is generated in the app; no posters or video
from any studio or streaming service are included. Live mode requests Cloudflare's
public speed-test endpoint (speed.cloudflare.com) and the public websites of
streaming services to measure the viewer's own connection.
